## Trigger

User says: **working / fast** but **worry 5-year stable** · **verify me** · **expert data / logic / architecture** · **push to A+**.

Run this **before claiming done** — any domain (customer, commission, RI, tabs, print, API, cache), not only joint LOV.

## A+ scorecard (six axes — grade each)

| Area | A+ pass | B or fail |
|------|---------|-----------|
| **Architecture** | New slice file when shared would fat-diff or break legacy; shell = thin branch + delegate | Drive-by refactor; dual portals (FE+BE same gap); wrong layer (local DB vs INS/API) |
| **Data contracts** | One canonical shape; one error-key namespace; loaders return fresh data (not stale snapshot) | Mixed mappers; drift vs `checkTab*` / API; silent `??` fallbacks |
| **Logic** | Pure rules testable without Vue; one async portal; safe shared state (don’t overwrite parent when child context differs) | Same logic copy-pasted in components; race without seq/abort; guess fallbacks |
| **Cache / perf** | Shared memo/cache; lazy load; virtual scroll / debounce on large lists | `limit(-1)`; refetch per row; bypass cache “for speed” |
| **Consistency** | Quote + policy + endt same factory/helper | Divergent paths per shell that will diverge again |
| **Testability** | Pure module + small `scripts/verify-*.mjs` or Pest on rules | Logic only in SFC; no runnable check |

**Target:** all six **A+**. **Ship:** all **A** or **A+** with documented residual risks.

## LDA-PO walk (5-year lens)

| Lens | Ask |
|------|-----|
| **Logic** | Happy path · edge path · what runs on edit hydrate vs tab open · race on fast change |
| **Data** | Persisted fields vs UI-only · option shape · validation keys · scale (% vs decimal) |
| **Architecture** | Who owns state (parent vs row vs tab) · which API · legacy wall still intact? |
| **Portal** | Single module/function name for load/hydrate/save — one job each |
| **Others** | Permissions · i18n EN/KH · prod CSS grid · commit scope · smoke matrix |

## Residual risks (required honesty)

List 2–4 **known tradeoffs** with severity — don’t hide behind “it works today”.

| Severity | Example |
|----------|---------|
| Low | `v-for :key="index"` pre-existing |
| Medium | Shared pool holds one “active” type until reload |
| High | Would break legacy or wrong API contract — **fix before ship** |

## Verify matrix

1. **Automated** — `npm run build` if FE touched; `php artisan test` if PHP touched; domain `scripts/verify-*.mjs` if pure rules exist.
2. **Manual** — user path on `APP_URL`; Network tab for duplicate/wrong endpoint; edit hydrate vs create.
3. **Regression** — one legacy product path unchanged if scope was 7pj-only.

